        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jean-Claude Andro, L. M. Montgomery\n- Books: The Blythes Are Quoted, Anne of Green Gables\n- Places: Avonlea\n- Concepts: authorship, translation\n\nFacts:\n- Jean-Claude Andro translated the book The Blythes Are Quoted.\n- L. M. Montgomery wrote The Blythes Are Quoted.\n- L. M. Montgomery also wrote Anne of Green Gables.\n- The fictional community Avonlea is the setting of Anne of Green Gables.\n- The writer of The Blythes Are Quoted translated by Jean-Claude Andro and the writer of the book set in Avonlea were the same author, L. M. Montgomery.",
